WEBVTT

00:00:00.383 --> 00:00:03.225
In caregiving one small change rarely stays

00:00:03.116 --> 00:00:05.829
small An appointment moves A whole new

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.792
plan to coordinate

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.988
A calendar knows an appointment changed Someone

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.423
still has to connect the dots

00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:16.421
Meet Carestead One shared care picture so

00:00:16.313 --> 00:00:17.833
Maya doesn't have to keep rebuilding it

00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:18.324
in her head

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.076
Carestead what should I know about Alex

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:23.434
today

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:27.112
Carestead connects the change to what could

00:00:27.004 --> 00:00:28.100
fall through the cracks

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.212
I won't be available Friday What needs

00:00:33.104 --> 00:00:33.777
coverage

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.329
It looks ahead showing affected responsibilities and

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:38.369
gaps in coverage

00:00:39.225 --> 00:00:42.667
Then a coordinated next step Consequential changes

00:00:42.559 --> 00:00:45.815
wait for Maya's review Carestead helps coordinate

00:00:46.065 --> 00:00:47.620
Maya stays in control

00:00:48.242 --> 00:00:50.434
When someone else steps in the context

00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:51.355
moves with the care

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.346
Less to remember More room to be

00:00:55.238 --> 00:00:55.772
present

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:59.474
Carestead Less to carry More care to

00:00:59.364 --> 00:00:59.883
give
